From 8c03ad296562ae657893eb888827a995cb5cb2df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:15:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/23] fix(web): make contact consent card recoverable without
 losing the chat

The empty-state link pointed at /?accountSection=account, a query nothing
reads; it now opens the account bindings dialog in place via a cancelable
window event (falling back to ?account=identity navigation). Add a
re-check button after binding and a sign-in link on 401 instead of a
useless retry.
---
 .../StoreContactConsentCard.test.tsx          | 61 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../components/StoreContactConsentCard.tsx    | 52 ++++++++++++++--
 web/src/hooks/useSubplatformRoute.ts          | 15 +++++
 3 files changed, 120 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

